# LIN-AGENT-RUNTIME-004: Semantic Beam Search & Structured Hypothesis Recovery

## 1. Object & Scientific Mandate
Following `LIN-AGENT-RUNTIME-003` (which demonstrated 56.3% context reduction but revealed premature single-node commitment in root-cause localization):
> **Does Semantic Beam Search (call-graph topological ranking) paired with a Structured Hypothesis Ledger (active search memory with confidence decay & refutation tracking) improve Root-Cause Localization and Hypothesis Recovery Rate on blind debugging tasks compared to Greedy LIN and Chat Baselines?**

---

## 2. Architectural Evolution: Beam Search & Hypothesis Ledger

```text
                              FAILING TEST TRACE
                                      │
                                      ▼
                        [Semantic Substrate Call DAG]
                                      │
                                      ▼
                         [Semantic Beam Search Ranker]
               Beam: [Candidate_1 (0.90), Candidate_2 (0.75), Candidate_3 (0.60)]
                                      │
                                      ▼
             Attempt 1 ────────> Hypothesis H1 on Candidate_1
                                      │
                                  [TEST FAIL]
                                      │
                                      ▼
                         [Structured Hypothesis Ledger]
                         • H1 (Candidate_1) -> REFUTED
                         • Confidence Candidate_1 -> 0.0
                         • Shift Focus to Candidate_2 (Active H2)
                                      │
                                      ▼
             Attempt 2 ────────> Hypothesis H2 on Candidate_2
                                      │
                                  [TEST PASS]
                                      │
                                      ▼
                         [Hypothesis H2 -> VERIFIED]
```

---

## 3. Evaluated Arms
- **Arm A (RAW):** Zero-state baseline.
- **Arm B (CHAT):** Textual error history buffer.
- **Arm C1 (LIN Greedy):** Previous single-node greedy localizer.
- **Arm C2 (LIN Beam + Hypothesis Ledger):** Multi-attempt beam progression.
